      "role": "user",
      "content": "but he's still making that horrible sound and his chest is pulling in when he breathes... if i wait 5 minutes between puffs he might stop breathing entirely!! wouldnt it be better to just give him a big dose now to get the airway open ASAP? i really need to know if that extra bit would help more since he's in such bad shape right now",
